<Item XName="Notes" UserName="Notes" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt; &#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;LTE_A_DL_SISO_DPS&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Example Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;Note:&lt;/B&gt; This example&amp;nbsp;is for LTE Advanced library (version 2014.05)&amp;nbsp;based on&amp;nbsp;SystemVue 2013.08SP1.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;This&amp;nbsp;example workspace&amp;nbsp;demonstrates&amp;nbsp;dynamic point selection in LTE-Advanced&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-family: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;There are two transmission points (LTE_A_DL_Src)&amp;nbsp;with different cell ID (set in GlobalVars) in the design. The UE (LTE_A_DL_Rcv) receives the combination of the two signals, which are transmitted from two Tx points (TP) and passed through two independent fading channels.&amp;nbsp;Two different configuration of CSI RS are transmitted from two TPs respectively. The resources occupied by CSI RS in one TP is configured to transmit zero power CSI RS in the other TP, i.e. there is no interferece between the CSI RS processes transmitted from two TPs.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-family: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&quot;&gt;At the beginning, data (PDSCH) is transmitted from TP1.The UE then demodulates the received data with cell ID of TP1. At the same time, UE estimates the channel condition of two TPs using CSI RS processes. Based on the channel state, the TP with better channel condition will be selected in future transmission. The delay of the CQI feedback is set by CQI_Delay in GlobalVars.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-family: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-family: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&quot;&gt;It should be noted that in this example, only SISO is supported. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-family: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-family: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&quot;&gt;The BER/BLER&amp;nbsp;are shown in the graphs. The performance of DPS and single Tx point are compared, where single Tx point means there is only one transmission point, UE receives signal from this TP without interference. As can be seen from the curves, around 2dB improvement can be got from DPS with default configuration (FDD, 5MHz bandwidth, 25RB allocated)&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-family: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-family: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&quot;&gt;To configure the single TP simulation, please set SimMode to 1, then select configuration as SingleTxPoint in LTE_A_DL_SISO_DPS_Analysis.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
